---
interface Props { data:any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
import { BMI_LMS, WFA_LMS, PCT_ADULTO, MOCHILA_MAX } from '../lib/hubs/crecimiento-infantil';
---
<div class="growth-experience">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="crumb"><b>Salud</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Crecimiento infantil</div>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Guía de crecimiento infantil</div>
            <h1>¿Está creciendo bien tu hijo?</h1>
            <p class="lead">Ubicá su peso y altura en la curva para su edad. Te mostramos el percentil en palabras simples y qué mirar en el próximo control.</p>
            <div class="stamps"><span class="stamp">✓ Tablas OMS y CDC</span><span class="stamp">◷ De 0 a 18 años</span><span class="stamp">♡ Orientativo</span></div>
            <div class="growth-art">
              <div class="leaf"></div><div class="ruler"></div>
              <div class="kid"><div class="head"></div><div class="body"></div><div class="legs"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Veamos su crecimiento</h2><div class="panel-sub">Empezamos por el IMC para la edad.</div></div><span class="badge">Tablas oficiales</span></div>
            <div class="label">¿Qué querés mirar?</div>
            <div class="cases">
              <button class="case active" data-case="imc"><span>📈</span>IMC por edad</button>
              <button class="case" data-case="pct"><span>📏</span>Peso y talla</button>
              <button class="case" data-case="adult"><span>🌱</span>Talla adulta</button>
              <button class="case" data-case="bag"><span>🎒</span>Mochila escolar</button>
            </div>
            <div class="label">Datos del chico o la chica</div>
            <div class="fields">
              <div class="field"><label for="growth-sex">Sexo</label><select id="growth-sex"><option value="m">Varón</option><option value="f">Mujer</option></select></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="growth-age">Edad</label><input id="growth-age" type="number" min="0" max="18" step=".5" value="8"><b class="unit">años</b></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="growth-weight">Peso</label><input id="growth-weight" type="number" min="2" max="150" step=".1" value="26"><b class="unit">kg</b></div>
              <div class="field wide"><label for="growth-height">Talla (altura)</label><input id="growth-height" type="number" min="40" max="210" step=".5" value="128"><b class="unit">cm</b></div>
              <div class="field growth-parents" hidden><label for="growth-father">Altura padre</label><input id="growth-father" type="number" value="176"><b class="unit">cm</b></div>
              <div class="field growth-parents" hidden><label for="growth-mother">Altura madre</label><input id="growth-mother" type="number" value="163"><b class="unit">cm</b></div>
              <div class="field wide growth-bag" hidden><label for="growth-bag">Mochila cargada</label><input id="growth-bag" type="number" min="0" step=".1" value="2.4"><b class="unit">kg</b></div>
            </div>
            <div class="result">
              <div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">IMC para la edad</small><h3 id="result-main">Percentil 49</h3></div><div class="status" id="result-status">DENTRO DE<br>LO ESPERADO</div></div>
              <div class="track-wrap"><div class="marker"></div><div class="track"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="track-labels"><span>P3</span><span>Rango esperado</span><span>P85</span><span>P97</span></div></div>
	              <div class="result-meta"><div><small id="growth-meta1-label">IMC calculado</small><b id="growth-meta1">15,9 kg/m²</b></div><div><small id="growth-meta2-label">Mediana de su edad</small><b id="growth-meta2">16,0 kg/m²</b></div><div><small>Referencia</small><b id="ref">CDC 2000</b></div></div>
	              <button class="cta" id="growth-update">Actualizar crecimiento</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="center"><div class="section-kicker">SU CURVA, EN CONTEXTO</div><h2 class="section-title">Un percentil no es una nota</h2><p class="section-lead">Lo importante no es estar en el medio: es sostener una curva de crecimiento saludable en el tiempo.</p></div>
        <div class="understand">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Los números detrás del resultado</h3>
	            <div class="child-data"><div class="metric"><small>Peso actual</small><strong id="growth-detail-weight">26 kg</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Talla actual</small><strong id="growth-detail-height">128 cm</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>IMC</small><strong id="growth-detail-bmi">15,9</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Percentil</small><strong id="growth-detail-pct">P49</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Piso esperado</small><strong>P3</strong></div><div class="metric"><small>Techo esperado</small><strong>P85</strong></div></div>
	            <div class="callout">💡 <b id="growth-explain">P49 significa que, de 100 chicos de la misma edad y sexo, aproximadamente 49 tienen un IMC menor.</b> No quiere decir que esté “49% bien”.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Cómo viene su curva</h3>
            <div class="curve"><div class="curve-lines"></div><svg class="svg" viewBox="0 0 500 180" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M5 145 C100 133 145 116 230 98 S380 58 495 45" fill="none" stroke="#bad9cf" stroke-width="16" opacity=".55"/><path d="M5 146 C100 137 165 115 245 96 S382 64 495 52" fill="none" stroke="#27a77b" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="245" cy="96" r="9" fill="#fff" stroke="#27a77b" stroke-width="5"/></svg></div>
            <div class="axis"><span>2 años</span><span>5 años</span><span>8 años · hoy</span><span>12 años</span><span>18 años</span></div>
            <div class="curve-legend"><span><i class="dot" style="background:#bad9cf"></i>Franja esperada</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#27a77b"></i>Curva estimada</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-kicker">TODAS LAS MIRADAS</div><h2 class="section-title">Cuatro respuestas con los mismos datos</h2><p class="section-lead">Podés cambiar de cálculo sin empezar de nuevo.</p>
        <div class="case-grid">
	          <button type="button" class="case-card" data-case-card="imc"><div class="ico">📈</div><h3>IMC para la edad</h3><p>El peso se interpreta según edad, talla y sexo. Te ubicamos en una franja clara.</p><b>P3 · P85 · P97 →</b></button>
	          <button type="button" class="case-card" data-case-card="pct"><div class="ico">📏</div><h3>Percentil de peso y talla</h3><p>Curvas OMS hasta los 5 años y lectura de IMC para edades mayores.</p><b>Ver su percentil →</b></button>
	          <button type="button" class="case-card" data-case-card="adult"><div class="ico">🌱</div><h3>Talla adulta estimada</h3><p>Combina la altura de mamá y papá con la talla que ya alcanzó.</p><b>Ver rango probable →</b></button>
	          <button type="button" class="case-card" data-case-card="bag"><div class="ico">🎒</div><h3>Mochila escolar</h3><p>Calcula el 10% de su peso y compara cuánto lleva hoy al colegio.</p><b>Revisar la mochila →</b></button>
        </div>
        <div class="doctor"><div class="plus">+</div><div><strong>Este resultado orienta, no diagnostica</strong><p>El pediatra evalúa la curva completa, antecedentes, contextura y momento del desarrollo.</p></div><a>Qué conviene llevar al control →</a></div>
      </div>
	    </section>
      <section class="support wrap"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><aside><h2>Fuentes oficiales</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside></section>
	  </div>
	<script is:inline define:vars={{ BMI:BMI_LMS, WFA:WFA_LMS, PCTA:PCT_ADULTO, BAGMAX:MOCHILA_MAX }}>
  (()=>{const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),n=id=>Number($(id).value)||0,dec=x=>x.toLocaleString('es-AR',{maximumFractionDigits:1});let kase='imc';
  const lookup=(t,x)=>{x=Math.max(t[0][0],Math.min(t[t.length-1][0],x));let i=t.findIndex(r=>r[0]>=x);if(i<=0)return t[Math.max(0,i)];const a=t[i-1],b=t[i],f=(x-a[0])/(b[0]-a[0]);return[x,a[1]+f*(b[1]-a[1]),a[2]+f*(b[2]-a[2]),a[3]+f*(b[3]-a[3])]};
  const cdf=z=>{const t=1/(1+.2316419*Math.abs(z)),p=.39894228*Math.exp(-z*z/2)*(t*(.31938153+t*(-.356563782+t*(1.781477937+t*(-1.821255978+t*1.330274429)))));return z>=0?1-p:p};const z=(v,r)=>Math.abs(r[1])<1e-9?Math.log(v/r[2])/r[3]:(Math.pow(v/r[2],r[1])-1)/(r[1]*r[3]);const band=p=>p<3?['POR DEBAJO<br>DEL P3','warn']:p<85?['DENTRO DE<br>LO ESPERADO','good']:p<97?['SOBREPESO<br>P85–P97','warn']:['POR ENCIMA<br>DEL P97','warn'];
  const calc=()=>{const sex=$('growth-sex').value,age=n('growth-age'),weight=n('growth-weight'),height=n('growth-height'),bmi=height?weight/Math.pow(height/100,2):0;let main='',label='',status='',ref='',m1='',m2='',p=null;
  if(kase==='adult'){const father=n('growth-father'),mother=n('growth-mother'),target=(father+mother+(sex==='m'?13:-13))/2,table=PCTA[sex],a=Math.max(8,Math.min(18,Math.round(age))),projected=age>=8&&height?height/table[a]*100:target,central=(target+projected)/2;label='Talla adulta estimada';main='≈ '+Math.round(central)+' cm';status='RANGO PROBABLE<br>'+Math.round(target-8.5)+'–'+Math.round(target+8.5)+' CM';ref='Tanner + WHO';m1='Diana: '+dec(target)+' cm';m2='Por edad: '+dec(projected)+' cm'}
  else if(kase==='bag'){const ideal=weight*.1,actual=n('growth-bag'),limit=(BAGMAX.find(x=>age<=x.hasta)||BAGMAX[BAGMAX.length-1]).absoluto*weight;label='Mochila recomendada';main='Hasta '+dec(ideal)+' kg';status=actual<=ideal?'DENTRO DEL<br>LÍMITE IDEAL':actual<=limit?'SOBRE EL IDEAL<br>REVISAR CARGA':'SUPERA EL<br>MÁXIMO';ref='Guía pediátrica';m1='Hoy: '+dec(actual)+' kg';m2='Máximo: '+dec(limit)+' kg'}
  else{let row;if(kase==='pct'&&age<=5){row=lookup(WFA[sex],age*12);p=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,cdf(z(weight,row))*100));label='Peso para la edad';ref='OMS 2006';m1=dec(weight)+' kg';m2='P50: '+dec(row[2])+' kg'}else{row=lookup(BMI[sex],age*12);p=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,cdf(z(bmi,row))*100));label=kase==='pct'?'IMC para la edad':'IMC para la edad';ref='CDC 2000';m1=dec(bmi)+' kg/m²';m2='P50: '+dec(row[2])+' kg/m²'}main='Percentil '+Math.round(p);status=band(p)[0]}
  $('result-label').textContent=label;$('result-main').textContent=main;$('result-status').innerHTML=status;$('ref').textContent=ref;$('growth-meta1').textContent=m1;$('growth-meta2').textContent=m2;$('growth-detail-weight').textContent=dec(weight)+' kg';$('growth-detail-height').textContent=dec(height)+' cm';$('growth-detail-bmi').textContent=dec(bmi);$('growth-detail-pct').textContent=p==null?'—':'P'+Math.round(p);$('growth-explain').textContent=p==null?'Esta estimación es orientativa y se interpreta con el pediatra.':'P'+Math.round(p)+' significa que, de 100 chicos de la misma edad y sexo, aproximadamente '+Math.round(p)+' tienen un valor menor.';document.querySelector('.marker').style.transform='translateX('+(p==null?50:p-49)+'%)';document.querySelectorAll('.case').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.case===kase));document.querySelectorAll('.growth-parents').forEach(x=>x.hidden=kase!=='adult');document.querySelector('.growth-bag').hidden=kase!=='bag'};
  const choose=k=>{kase=k;calc();document.querySelector('.panel').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'})};document.querySelectorAll('[data-case]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>choose(b.dataset.case)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-case-card]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>choose(b.dataset.caseCard)));document.querySelectorAll('.panel input,.panel select').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('input',calc));$('growth-update').addEventListener('click',()=>{calc();$('growth-update').textContent='Crecimiento actualizado ✓';setTimeout(()=>$('growth-update').textContent='Actualizar crecimiento',1500)});calc()})();
  </script>
<style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box} :root{--ink:#10213d;--muted:#5e718d;--line:#d9e4ed;--blue:#236be8;--mint:#27a77b;--mint2:#e9f8f2;--violet:#7650dc;--yellow:#ffc958;--peach:#fff1e9;--bg:#f4f9fb}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:white} button,input{font:inherit}
    .wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    header{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}
    header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:44px}.brand{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#183553;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#344760;flex:1;justify-content:center}.tools{display:flex;gap:10px}.tool{padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tool.dark{background:#163352;color:#fff;border-color:#163352}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5fbff 0%,#f2fbf7 62%,#fffaf1 100%);padding:30px 0 70px}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:var(--blue)}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mint);font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:var(--mint)}
    h1{font-size:47px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2.2px;margin:20px 0 20px}.lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);max-width:490px}.stamps{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.stamp{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:11px;color:#425776}
    .growth-art{height:240px;position:relative;margin-top:28px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center}.ruler{width:265px;height:180px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cfe0e8;border-radius:25px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(37,91,118,.10);overflow:hidden}.ruler:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:26px;top:0;bottom:0;width:34px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0 13px,#adc4d3 13px 15px)}.ruler:after{content:"CRECER ES UNA CURVA, NO UN NÚMERO";position:absolute;right:16px;top:34px;width:125px;color:#41647a;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
    .kid{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:127px;width:98px;height:185px}.head{position:absolute;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffccad;left:20px;top:0;border:7px solid #563c31}.body{position:absolute;width:75px;height:100px;background:var(--yellow);left:12px;top:52px;border-radius:28px 28px 16px 16px}.legs{position:absolute;width:13px;height:54px;background:#294b72;left:26px;bottom:0;border-radius:8px}.legs:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:13px;height:54px;background:#294b72;left:35px;border-radius:8px}.leaf{position:absolute;right:35px;bottom:18px;width:85px;height:85px;border-radius:70% 0 70% 0;background:#bcebd7;transform:rotate(-12deg)}
    .panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d4e2e9;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(35,76,104,.13)}.panel-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start}.panel h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 5px}.panel-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.badge{font-size:10px;background:var(--mint2);color:#188261;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800}
    .label{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;margin:18px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}.case{min-height:74px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 6px;color:#526783;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.case span{display:block;font-size:21px;margin-bottom:4px}.case.active{border:2px solid var(--mint);background:#f1fbf7;color:#147356}
	    .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:9px 12px;min-height:58px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 3}.field small,.field label{display:block;color:#74869c;font-size:9px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;background:transparent;outline:0;color:#10213d;font-weight:800;width:76%;font-size:14px}.field strong{font-size:14px}.unit{float:right;font-size:11px}
    .result{margin-top:14px;background:#153653;border-radius:17px;padding:20px;color:white}.result-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.result small{color:#c6d9e6;font-size:9px}.result h3{font-size:36px;margin:5px 0 1px}.status{background:#e7fbf2;color:#16815f;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.track-wrap{margin:17px 0 12px}.track{height:16px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:3fr 82fr 12fr 3fr;gap:2px}.track i:nth-child(1){background:#f3c260}.track i:nth-child(2){background:#51c59d}.track i:nth-child(3){background:#f6a35a}.track i:nth-child(4){background:#ee6c70}.marker{position:relative;height:16px}.marker:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:49%;top:-20px;width:3px;height:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,.22)}.track-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:8px;color:#c7d9e4}.result-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;border-top:1px solid #365572;margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px}.result-meta b{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:3px}.cta{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:11px;background:var(--mint);color:white;padding:13px;margin-top:15px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
    section{padding:74px 0}.center{text-align:center}.section-kicker{font-size:10px;color:var(--mint);letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800}.section-title{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-1.4px;margin:14px 0}.section-lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
    .understand{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:20px;margin-top:42px}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:25px;background:#fff}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 20px}.child-data{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.metric{padding:15px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:13px}.metric small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px}.metric strong{display:block;font-size:18px;margin-top:7px}.callout{margin-top:18px;padding:15px;border-radius:13px;background:#fff8e8;border:1px solid #f5d58a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#765416}
    .curve{height:210px;position:relative;padding:15px 10px 25px}.curve-lines{position:absolute;inset:15px 10px 35px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 0 34px,#e3ebf0 34px 35px)}.svg{position:absolute;inset:10px;width:calc(100% - 20px);height:175px}.axis{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;color:#789}.curve-legend{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:9px;margin-top:10px}.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;margin-right:5px}
	    .case-section{background:#f4f2fb}.case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:38px}.case-card{appearance:none;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:20px;min-height:218px;cursor:pointer}.case-card .ico{width:43px;height:43px;border-radius:13px;background:var(--mint2);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:22px}.case-card h3{font-size:15px;margin:17px 0 8px}.case-card p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);min-height:52px}.case-card b{font-size:11px;color:var(--violet)}.doctor{margin-top:34px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:18px;padding:19px 22px;display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:center}.doctor .plus{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#e8f7f1;color:var(--mint);font-size:24px;font-weight:800}.doctor strong{font-size:13px}.doctor p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0}.doctor a{margin-left:auto;color:var(--mint);font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#687a8f}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:var(--mint);text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#78899c;margin-top:4px}
	    @media(max-width:800px){nav,.tools{display:none}.hero-grid,.understand,.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cases,.case-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}h1{font-size:40px}}
  </style>
